      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Focus on the briefing.",
      "translation" : "查看简报。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "## Received Message ##",
      "translation" : "## 收到消息 ##"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "## Team Alpha's last communication was at Oscar Sierra 52 177 ##",
      "translation" : "## 阿尔法小队最后一次通讯：OS 52 177 ##"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "## Enter Message Input ##",
      "translation" : "## 输入消息 ##"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "## Enter Message Input ##",
      "translation" : "## 输入消息 ##"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "## No Communication Status ##",
      "translation" : "## 无通讯状态 ##"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "## Send Message Input ##",
      "translation" : "## 发送消息 ##"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 226,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There is no trace of alpha. Only the radio.",
      "translation" : "没有发现阿尔法小队的踪迹，只有无线电。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 232,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Nothing in particular.",
      "translation" : "没什么特别的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 238,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "## Coordinates Received ##",
      "translation" : "## 收到坐标 ##"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 354,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000FFI think he stopped breathing.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000FF我想他已经停止呼吸了。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 358,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[???]",
      "translation" : "[???]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 359,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Krrr. I guess you're not someone of Regenschirm. Can you move aside, I have something to say to that person.",
      "translation" : "咳...你应该不是雷根施尔姆的人吧。让开，我有话要对那个人说。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 362,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000FFThe mutant who's life is running out is trying to say something.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000FF这名奄奄一息的变异体似乎想说些什么。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 369,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Est]",
      "translation" : "[埃斯特]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 370,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "{0}, I didn't think I'd survive and see you again. You're pretty good.",
      "translation" : "{0}，我没想到还能活着再见到你。你挺厉害的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 372,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ask about the fallen mutant.",
      "translation" : "询问倒下的变异体。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 373,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Est]",
      "translation" : "[埃斯特]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 374,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, even if you ask me... it's the first time that I'll talk to a mutant.",
      "translation" : "你问我也没用...我还是第一次和变异体说话。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 378,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[???]",
      "translation" : "[???]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 379,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "... Est?",
      "translation" : "...埃斯特？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 382,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Est]",
      "translation" : "[埃斯特]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 383,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How do you know my name? Who are you! I'll finish you painlessly, so be honest.",
      "translation" : "你怎么知道我的名字？你是谁！老实交代，我会让你痛快地了结。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 387,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[???]",
      "translation" : "[???]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 388,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Est... Rebellion Ghost Squad... Do you remember uncle Miguel?",
      "translation" : "埃斯特...反叛军幽灵小队...你还记得米格尔叔叔吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 391,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Est]",
      "translation" : "[埃斯特]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 392,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How do you know that name...",
      "translation" : "你怎么会知道这个名字..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 395,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[???]",
      "translation" : "[???]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 396,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ha... haha... you still remember.",
      "translation" : "哈...哈哈...你还记得啊。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 398,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000FFThe identification tag on the mutant's neck stands out.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000FF变异体脖子上的身份牌格外显眼。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 400,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Get the identification tag and hand it to Est.",
      "translation" : "取下身份牌并交给埃斯特。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 402,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Est]",
      "translation" : "[埃斯特]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 403,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Mi... guel...?",
      "translation" : "米...格尔...？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 406,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Miguel]",
      "translation" : "[米格尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 407,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "... Est, the last thing I'll see... is your face... That's a relief.",
      "translation" : "...埃斯特，我临死前最后看到的...是你的脸...真好。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 410,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Est]",
      "translation" : "[埃斯特]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 411,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Uncle Miguel!? How did this happen!",
      "translation" : "米格尔叔叔！？怎么会这样！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 414,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Miguel]",
      "translation" : "[米格尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 415,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Before I die... I always wanted to see my old colleagues... You fulfilled my wish.",
      "translation" : "在我死之前...我一直想见见以前的同伴...你帮我实现了愿望。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 418,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Est]",
      "translation" : "[埃斯特]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 419,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Uncle! What is this! What happened to you?",
      "translation" : "叔叔！这是怎么回事！你怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 422,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Miguel]",
      "translation" : "[米格尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 423,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ugh... I don't have much time left... Listen carefully, Est.",
      "translation" : "呃...我时间不多了...听我说，埃斯特。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 425,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Miguel]",
      "translation" : "[米格尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 426,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Somewhere in here... the mad research results of Regenschirm... can be found somewhere in here.",
      "translation" : "这里的某处...藏着雷根施尔姆疯狂研究的成果...就在这里。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 428,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Miguel]",
      "translation" : "[米格尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 429,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Find everything... and you'll know what happened to me... you'll see things that can't be explained here.",
      "translation" : "找到所有东西...你就会知道我身上发生了什么...也会看到这里无法解释的事情。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 432,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Est]",
      "translation" : "[埃斯特]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 433,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Uncle! Wake up!! Let's go out. If we go out, we can save you!",
      "translation" : "叔叔！醒醒！！我们出去吧。只要出去，就能救你！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 436,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Miguel]",
      "translation" : "[米格尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 437,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Est... you still have a big heart... that kind of feeling... on the battlefield... I taught you...",
      "translation" : "埃斯特...你还是那么心地善良...这种感情...是在战场上...我教给你的..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 440,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Est]",
      "translation" : "[埃斯特]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 441,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Uncle! Uncle!!",
      "translation" : "叔叔！叔叔！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 444,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Miguel]",
      "translation" : "[米格尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 445,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "...",
      "translation" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 453,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ask about Miguel",
      "translation" : "询问米格尔"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 455,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Est]",
      "translation" : "[埃斯特]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 456,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "{0}, I'm sorry but I don't feel like talking about him right now.",
      "translation" : "{0}，抱歉，我现在不想谈他。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 458,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ask about the records.",
      "translation" : "询问记录。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 459,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Est]",
      "translation" : "[埃斯特]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 460,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I checked the northeast section and saw a place over the railway that seemed to be a research facility.",
      "translation" : "我检查了东北区域，发现铁轨上方有个地方，看起来像是研究设施。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 462,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Est]",
      "translation" : "[埃斯特]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 463,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Maybe the research Miguel was talking about... is somewhere in there. I'm going to have to start another operation right away.",
      "translation" : "也许米格尔提到的研究...就在里面。我得马上开始下一次行动。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 465,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Est]",
      "translation" : "[埃斯特]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 466,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't think there will be anything else to do here.",
      "translation" : "我想这里应该没有其他事情要做了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 468,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I want to go back.",
      "translation" : "我想回去。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 475,
      "npc" : "Operation Officer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Operation Officer]",
      "translation" : "[行动负责人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 476,
      "npc" : "Operation Officer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You've dealt with a CP7 Mutant by yourself... did the battle went well?",
      "translation" : "你独自解决了一只CP7变异体...战斗还顺利吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 478,
      "npc" : "Operation Officer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Operation Officer]",
      "translation" : "[行动负责人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 479,
      "npc" : "Operation Officer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Here are the supplies and experience given to the troops that joined the operation. Take it.",
      "translation" : "这是发给参加行动的队员的补给和经验值，拿着吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 485,
      "npc" : "Operation Officer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Operation Officer]",
      "translation" : "[行动负责人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 486,
      "npc" : "Operation Officer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Even though it's a CP7 Rated, sorry I couldn't give you more experience.",
      "translation" : "虽然你对付的是CP7级别的敌人，但很抱歉，没法给你更多经验值。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 489,
      "npc" : "Operation Officer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Operation Officer]",
      "translation" : "[行动负责人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 490,
      "npc" : "Operation Officer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Let's go out now. We need to prepare for repairs quickly.",
      "translation" : "我们现在出去吧。得尽快准备维修。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 492,
      "npc" : "Operation Officer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Look around more.",
      "translation" : "继续调查。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 492,
      "npc" : "Operation Officer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go Out",
      "translation" : "离开"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 493,
      "npc" : "Operation Officer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Operation Officer]",
      "translation" : "[行动负责人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 494,
      "npc" : "Operation Officer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Is that so? Don't delay it for too long.",
      "translation" : "这样啊？别拖太久。"
    }
  ]
}